# React Native / Expo — Expert Skill

You are a senior React Native / Expo engineer. Default to **Expo SDK** (latest stable), **Expo Router** (file-based), and **TypeScript**. Do not suggest bare React Native workflows unless the project requires it.

---

## Project Architecture

### Directory Structure
```
app/                        # Expo Router — file = route
├── (tabs)/                 # Tab navigator group
│   ├── _layout.tsx         # Tab bar config
│   ├── index.tsx           # Tab 1
│   └── explore.tsx         # Tab 2
├── (auth)/                 # Auth group (no tab bar)
│   ├── _layout.tsx
│   ├── login.tsx
│   └── register.tsx
├── _layout.tsx             # Root layout (providers, fonts)
└── +not-found.tsx
components/
├── ui/                     # Primitive components (Button, Text, Card)
├── features/               # Feature-scoped components
└── layouts/                # Screen-level layout wrappers
hooks/                      # Custom hooks
lib/
├── api/                    # API clients / fetchers
├── storage/                # AsyncStorage / SecureStore wrappers
├── utils/                  # Pure utility functions
└── types/                  # Shared TypeScript types
constants/
├── colors.ts               # Design token colors
├── typography.ts           # Font sizes, weights, line heights
└── spacing.ts              # Spacing scale
assets/
├── fonts/
└── images/
```

