## Accessibility

Every interactive element must have:
- `accessibilityRole` — button, link, image, header, etc.
- `accessibilityLabel` — human-readable label (not icon names)
- `accessibilityHint` — what happens when activated (optional but preferred)
- `accessibilityState` — disabled, selected, checked, busy

